updated_at: "2026-10-27T03:16:55.298Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce the real-wall-clock SIGKILL sequence in disposable non-Git trackers on the reported old and current versions; If confirmed fix preserves mutation fencing and audit history with negative controls for live and unknown owners; Separate monotonic acquisition deadlines from owner liveness and verify Node and Bun public SDK behavior
parent: pm-02z97f
expected_result: "A provably dead writer is recovered safely after an interrupted commit, and bounded acquisition does not hang under a frozen wall clock; live or ambiguous ownership retains protection."
