  "2026-10-27T03:16:18.150Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete3135-item strict full all-status corpus has no exact GH1609 owner, no unreadable items and no omissions. Request-specific search, open and zero-in-progress inventories were read. Full live pm-02z97f data confirms its earlier audited dead-owner recovery is closed/completed, not newly outstanding. This newly reported crash-inside-fence scenario is a bounded follow-up. Current source includes both owner_dead_recovery_attempt and the independent commit fence in src/core/lock/lock.ts; the report has not yet been independently reproduced. Keep this intake open/unclaimed; do not treat reported symptoms as a proven root cause."
